  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『機動戦士ガンダム SEED』に登場するアスランの搭乗機「MG 1/100 イージスガンダム」がクリアカラーになって登場！",
      "en": "Athrun's aircraft \"MG 1/100 Aegis Gundam \" that appears in \" Mobile Suit Gundam SEED\" is now available in clear color!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 成型色が透明度の高いクリアピンク等に変更され、組み立てるだけで美しい仕上がりに。",
      "en": "• The molding color has been changed to a highly transparent clear pink, etc., creating a beautiful finish just by assembling."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 砲撃形態と巡航形態の２種類のMA形態へ完全変形。",
      "en": "• Completely transforms into two types of MA modes: bombardment mode and cruise mode."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 肘、つま先に取り付け可能なビームサーベルのエフェクトパーツが付属。",
      "en": "• Comes with beam saber effect parts that can be attached to the elbows and toes."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• プラモデルオリジナルのデカールが付属。",
      "en": "• Comes with original plastic model decals."
    }
  ],
